-- title:
--   Dyadic tails of a decreasing sequence
-- statement:
--   Let $M_d\ge0$ be decreasing in $d$, and $k\le N$. Then
--   $$
--   \sum_{d=k}^{N-1}2^{-(d+1)}M_d\le2^{-k}M_k .
--   $$
--
--   Tolerances of the form $2^{-(d+1)}m_d$ have tails bounded by their first budget.
-- source:
--   https://github.com/openai/math/blob/1581d4cbdd69a0faf34b2089614fe2a814316a6a/lean/OAI/Analysis/Nonexpansive/SwitchingScalar.lean#L103-L121

